日称，“欧洲继续致力于实现贸易伙伴关系多元化，与占全球贸易87%的国家进行接触，共同致力于自由开放的商品、服务和思想交流。” 彭博社称，冯德莱恩10日提到，欧盟将进一步转向亚洲，并表示将探索与《全面与进步跨太平洋伙伴关系协定》（CPTPP）成员加强合作。该协定涵盖从澳大利亚到加拿大的贸易区。新西兰总理拉克森提议以该协定为基础，与欧盟就构建一个基于规则的贸易集团达成更广泛的协议。拉近对华经贸关系，冯德莱恩：欧盟将进一步转向亚洲_腾讯新闻"},"attached_info":"CkoI6sHFoYe+ksUoEAMaCTExNDQ4NTA4MyCPmPG/BjAAONMKQA1yEzE4OTUwMTkyMjg3NjA4NjA0NjV4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"58 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-b79b088bf020fd7c68bbfaaa294c9eb9_b.jpg"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"14_1744655058.581399","card_id":"Q_574032663","target":{"id":574032663,"title":"《三国演义》中许褚的武力怎么样？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/574032663","type":"question","created":1671765883,"answer_count":59,"follower_count":74,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[3676,11066,161750,171421],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":""},"attached_info":"Cj4I6sHFoYe+ksUoEAMaCDg5ODQ0OTk4IPu+lJ0GMAA4SkAOcgk1NzQwMzI2NjN4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"57 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-ecc4658843a174d2ac9c13fa296bfdac_b.jpg"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"15_1744655058.581662","card_id":"Q_1894701862944491165","target":{"id":1894701862944491300,"title":"中国武术的硬功肉掌劈石、单指断石之类的，在街斗实战中有用吗？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1894701862944491165","type":"question","created":1744512125,"answer_count":38,"follower_count":61,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[41786],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":""},"attached_info":"CkkI6sHFoYe+ksUoEAMaCTExNDQ3MjE1OCD9yOy/BjAAOD1AD3ITMTg5NDcwMTg2Mjk0NDQ5MTE2NXgAqgEJYmlsbGJvYXJk0gEA","detail_text":"57 万热